Fenced text selects code mode automatically:
                                   ```
~~~                                const planets = [
const greeting = "Hello";             "Earth",
console.log(greeting);                "Mars",
~~~                                   "Jupiter",
                                    ];
                                   ```


Code mode can also be applied post hoc:

| Form                | Meaning
| ------------------- | --------------------------------
| `#id`               | Explicit entity ID
| `[Mission Control]` | Box label
| `<diamond>`         | Named hub marker

Text keeps  **bold**,  _italic_, and  `code`  literal.
:legend
%Form%: code
%Text keeps%: text
